  "_doc": "Tree registry — large collidable plants placed per-biome. Each tree blocks movement (narrow trunk collider), can be chopped for resources, and uses depth sorting so the player walks behind the canopy. Biomes use canonical indices from src/world/biomes.ts. Each species has growth stages (sapling → young → mature) with seasonal sprite variants. The scatter/render system reads `sprites[season]` (defaulting to `sprite` for backward compat). A future growth system will drive stage progression; a weather/calendar system will drive season changes.",
